{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy 3D platformer where an important letter travels across ages and worlds - through living origami, purring cats, quests and puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and the letter? That\u2019s you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/6713570346d0dcbd0d19606490b96fc1.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1080 height=119 /></span>It all began in the Archive of Memory - a place of fading thoughts, unsent words, and letters that were never read.<br>Forgotten, but not lost, they sleep in endless drawers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Among them was one special letter. No one remembers who wrote it anymore, but inside was a strange spark. Enough for the paper to tremble\u2026 and awaken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That same night, a Time Glitch flared up - and the letter vanished from the Archive.<br>Not stolen - escaped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somewhere out there, the addressee is still waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/bc63ec1ef262b45ca6bdeea2e7bceabe.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1080 height=115 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/135e47573ac6e9d6223f910e66e59fbc.poster.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/135e47573ac6e9d6223f910e66e59fbc.webm?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/135e47573ac6e9d6223f910e66e59fbc.mp4?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/39caf232acc7b828bf1e47ae103e1a46.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1080 height=77 /></span><br>Origament is your cozy escape after a long day. Relaxing gameplay, light puzzles, stunning views, and a mysterious story. This isn\u2019t about challenges - it\u2019s about enjoying the ride.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/997a6591054beb8b739601e836405b3d.poster.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/997a6591054beb8b739601e836405b3d.webm?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/997a6591054beb8b739601e836405b3d.mp4?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/ac7e1469c72b257bb8b47e9cf7b4ff0b.webp?t=1759184243\" width=1080 height=59 /></span>Be a paper boat drifting down a stream. A paper plane gliding through old Venice. Every world feels like a little meditation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/1ac7b941942815ca8a2db3bb4ac391f1.poster.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/1ac7b941942815ca8a2db3bb4ac391f1.webm?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/1ac7b941942815ca8a2db3bb4ac391f1.mp4?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/ed4001c97ccbe5a687afbbcafcc9451c.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1080 height=92 /></span><br>Each level opens a new era, a new place, a new mood. The challenge doesn\u2019t come from enemies, but from the environment and its clever puzzles.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/358233debfdc2fff145b86233db210eb.poster.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/358233debfdc2fff145b86233db210eb.webm?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/358233debfdc2fff145b86233db210eb.mp4?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/2347600deb4256fa48dc7f79769981a0.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1080 height=85 /></span><br>Change form to overcome obstacles. Every transformation means new physics, abilities, and vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/07ab9a9eba8af330dba0d48bc6b38b20.poster.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/07ab9a9eba8af330dba0d48bc6b38b20.webm?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/07ab9a9eba8af330dba0d48bc6b38b20.mp4?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/604d9d8582de6b1f4e9eeacad8f2dc08.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1080 height=79 /></span><br>This is not about combat - it\u2019s about curiosity, observation, and clever adaptation. The levels themselves become both your biggest challenge - and your greatest ally. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/fc1ee321a496d16165ec96c7876a75ce.poster.avif?t=1759184243\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/fc1ee321a496d16165ec96c7876a75ce.webm?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/extras/fc1ee321a496d16165ec96c7876a75ce.mp4?t=1759184243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Time's wind takes the sails","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871460/18481f38142313c56b288312f40d09e8cfd1e4e5.jpg"},{"name":"Purring lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871460/bb27793cf2dc2e410d4b50f923b133f828400c5d.jpg"},{"name":"Precious Paper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3871460/e51fb789dbeac5c99dbc8b22a4ed9282d62d0882.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3871460?t=1759184243","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/37f5dfb3a2f599a287f4abdb810984c1fff39591/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759184243","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3871460/2ca7bf8ebffaac51144a8b6fdb8d9783117a4801/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759184243"